{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0054_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "e979080c468f0c794b2d7e505f9b8c75f504df58c218ed54fd03a224cab1c113", "ja": "お気持ちにお応えするためにも、\n気合いを入れて挑まなくては、と……。", "zh": "为了回应官人的期待，\n小女子也得全力以赴才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
