{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0054_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "49498e87900639d00788805b6eefaa2c6d3b7c5e835945af41f8eafda0f636e0", "ja": "ふふっ。そのご信頼もまた、気負いのもとになりそうな\n気が致しますが……どうぞご安心ください。", "zh": "呵呵，官人对小女子如此信赖，\n反而更激励斗志了……但是请放心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0054_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "60505e00af524cfd48a40cb482fcb108e0b4319df1067c0f9f12465e3bdb1fd8", "ja": "今の私は、失敗する気がいたしません。\nきっと、良き仕事ができるかと……。", "zh": "小女子不认为现在的自己会失败。\n工作一定会十分顺利……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0054_1007_p", "source_sha256": "18114fb3beda7e8c086074a367f16d15e65476da7ae80331e9e02eda16d50e22", "ja": "おお、すごい自信だな。\nそれだけ言えるなら、本当に心配なさそうだ。", "zh": "喔喔，真是有自信。\n既然你都这么说了，看来真的不需要担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0054_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "6290face1b62f35deedd9091088b952215882a1acda387fece8b19eba7c35cd5", "ja": "この衣装を着ているだけで、感じるのです。\nあなた様が共にいてくれる、と……。", "zh": "光是穿上这套服装，就能有所感受。\n感受到官人与小女子同在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
